-#
  DEL-09, BR-23: for how many months calls are kept, and from which day on a
  call cannot be deleted. The administrator sets the period on the page
  Settings; a supervisor reads it.
%section.setting-card{ aria: { labelledby: "calls-kept-title" } }
  %h2#calls-kept-title How long calls are kept
  %p
    Calls are kept for #{tag.strong("#{setting.call_months} months")}: a call received on
    #{tag.strong(l(setting.calls_kept_from))} or later cannot be deleted.
  - if policy(:setting).update?
    %p.note= link_to "Change the period in Settings", settings_path
  - else
    %p.note The period is set by the administrator.
